          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആഗ്രഹം (āgrahaṁ) from Sanskrit āgraha, \"insistence, eager desire\", taken over whole as a tatsama, with Malayalam's noun ending -ṁ."
